{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"1951c3e737307986aba6cc60611798f4aaf674f27e3f16751b39fd61f9d7c55d","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"880a05d14dd0e1e2f2d677d7be7e7509ca30c757edee987b52130e013f716cad","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"原文“Your successful melee hits”限定为近战命中，oppression.lua Horrifying Blows 仅在 callbackOnMeleeAttack 且 hitted 时施加 EFF_INFERNAL_FEAR；译文“你的攻击能够惊吓目标”删去“近战/命中”限定，把触发范围扩大到任意攻击。（DLC 来源未固定）"},{"revision_key":"886c20b244c332eb87da191b9a3bf3a4d334fc5a687f39a08ee89657b6206aff","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"89a4d5c92f7bfb07b70e633da61369d3eaa0590de614f5fc9766ad0afe8c039b","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The Black Crown 的 desc 为引号内俏皮话“For the demon who has everything.”（送给什么都不缺的恶魔的礼物），译文“魔中之魔，加冕为王”是另起的口号，含义不符，且丢掉了原文的引号。"},{"revision_key":"8c1bab1ad29bdca0dad216ec4ccd0002ff571f66185f4714b4dac13f35593b03","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8cc43b0e6eb5adc24ad822b8109d48b9adbd4fe87dcc2666cefdd002cbe93c0f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8d7b289755999deb531b03fdccfdd78457befa42639193acbe806c93dcd79397","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8dcc6c29ec0a5c3df731b97815851977f1ca4156579c334fedbfef28057e3ed6","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8ead5856883742dd1b169b8f6b082084cab2b6267e17e0311a4bbfc6934dae5f","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"unlock-race_doomelf.lua 第24行原文只说探险者本可以把“the truth”告诉恶魔，并说明玩家因此获得创建魔化精灵角色的资格；译文擅自把它具体化为“有关埃亚尔大陆的真相”，并把解锁资格改成含糊的“应运而生”。第22行译文还加入原文没有的“烈火”。"},{"revision_key":"90ae8f40d2a08477d67d7ed14e25ed88e91a0ae157afbfebc4cc2d78631b314a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"919188331c9705e5513c95c4ac838bb6784603b07ed4c98064b2fb24b0eba746","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"952fa9c1b8869a78fcf5b0cdc2b2a12b2770f674f72df625096c4d9c778f8d7a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"958319eb5e7461315b275db2517c2c0c18881434160ba7f249e8cf19c3ab155f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"9ac85a7a89f1ebd76f9f78a9fb05df008a23bdd9b228b0ac3d118ceaa4b43205","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"1）换行不变量：原文“scowl.”后有换行，译文“皱了皱眉#AQUAMARINE#”把前两行并成一行，原文5行变成4行。2）%s 在 walrog-pop.lua 第53行由 _t\"Traitor\"/_t\"Murderer\" 填入，原句是“（纳鲁精灵的）叛徒/凶手”，译文“%s纳鲁精灵”缺了“to the”对应的“……的”，语句不通。3）“Your 'loyalty...' would give me their fate”意为“信了你的‘忠诚’，我就会落得和他们一样的下场”，译文“还能骗得了谁？”意思不对。"},{"revision_key":"9d7afbedda50e66336107bbedb083a220fc84cd3e62776304cbdcfe82ae5d793","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The Black Maul 的 unided_name 为“massive black hammer”，源码中没有黑曜石材质；译文“黑曜石战锤”添加了原文没有的材质（黑曜石出现在另一件神器 The Black Crown 的“cracked obsidian crown”），应为黑色。"},{"revision_key":"9e25a17b1f561701bcaf00ec558056deef43d8ed17f80126826dd6ed08468c1b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"9e32f9dfdf50858636c3279f5638c34f257df75e051ed6af5f5ecf3277695db5","verdict":"OK"}]}